 "summary": "The first-order symbol construction, the complexification exactness lemma and the Koszul exactness lemma are stated at their natural generality (normed spaces for complexification, any commutative ring with a unit-valued functional for Koszul exactness), and the de Rham results are derived from them. The inner-product assumptions are needed for the complex normed structure on the L\u00b2 complexification, and the degree-zero lemmas are not duplicated by the general degree-(k+1) ones.",
